@startuml
title UC13 - Trình tự Tham gia phòng PUBLIC
actor "Người dùng" as User
participant "Flutter UI" as UI
participant "RoomClient" as RoomCli
participant "ApiService" as Api
participant "RoomController" as RoomCtrl
participant "RoomService (server)" as RoomSvc
database "MySQL" as DB

User -> UI: Chọn phòng PUBLIC từ danh sách
UI -> RoomCli: joinPublic(roomId)
RoomCli -> Api: POST /rooms/{id}/join
Api -> RoomCtrl: /rooms/{id}/join
RoomCtrl -> RoomSvc: addParticipant(roomId, userId)
RoomSvc -> DB: INSERT participant
DB --> RoomSvc: ok
RoomSvc --> RoomCtrl: participant added
RoomCtrl --> Api: 200 OK
Api --> RoomCli: OK
RoomCli -> UI: Điều hướng vào phòng/call
@enduml